    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="11" relname="span">I found the website to be friendly and easier to use for senior citizens.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="evidence">The font was clear</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="11" relname="evidence">and the content was clear.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="10" relname="evidence">The site does not include any flash</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="9" relname="evidence">and is not clutter with pictures that may confuse a person who is not used to using the Internet.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="8" relname="summary">It is very simple.</segment>
